<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-11-14T14:22:18.977Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 14:22:18 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Philippines is hosting an ASEAN Maritime Center to boost regional cooperation while negotiating a South China Sea code of conduct that is now 70 percent complete, and it has signed a defence deal with Australia amid rising tensions. Chinese vessels have entered Scarborough Shoal and continued patrols near Diaoyu Dao, prompting Manila to summon the Chinese ambassador, while the Philippine Coast Guard cleaned up an oil spill from a sunken landing craft tank off Surigao del Sur. The US Coast Guard cutter Bertholf conducted flight operations in the South China Sea, and former NPA rebels were redeployed as forest guards in Borongan. 176 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxQTkFzV2FpWkdORnNJVjQtcWVtRk1EX3FsaUVBMXFjRWdhRmVTazNjV05JUW1KbEd6U3Bva0RsY0VOVFB4M05qRzZab09DbThzTi13NnBMVERwR0VrZEVpUFd1aTR3cXFxX1o5dVFiQ3RJSHRPcnhyTEJyZ1d0VmRqR3ZTZFVVYzVyMVRIRmR3SEpLYUF0Q25YdUpocERYRmE4VFRiSnRkUHY?oc=5&quot;&gt;Manila Bulletin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxPMk1LTVZkQ2c2bWo3OGNyZ0VDMGY4RE13aXg4ckhreFpMLTU5bVdiWmx3cmNrX2dTR2Z5MHlxZEw1S1pQeWsxNFNjMVhueEI3emgwbzJmMVUtTkt1bERud0NrcEdYb1R5a01aM0ZZam9BNUlTZFljUS12a2pvTGljNmhCRWhFMHBNX2R3cnlhMGJkc1Y0WTZCVTI3SkFrcWM0VWxsYQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News &amp;amp; Headlines – Australian Broadcasting Corporation&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;SunStar Publishing Inc.&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Esquiremag.ph&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NST Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQZ2ZUOGFfWi1VNXV5TVNIbnp5RElpUWVyaE9nUkFTR1E4eF85eXZITGZDc0JCN29zZ25EbHhtWE15VXZDY0VpLXplNFFVRWptOUJHSlhvM0JYbnNsbzBBWFlla